    "id": "vendors",
    "title": "供應商管理",
    "summary": "依授權公司建立與維護供應商聯絡方式、統編及預設幣別。",
    "keywords": [
      "供應商",
      "vendor",
      "廠商",
      "聯絡人",
      "預設幣別"
    ],
    "path": "/vendors",
    "module": "vendor",
    "category": "採購庫存",
    "group": "inventory",
    "sections": {
      "steps": [
        "先選擇公司，在供應商管理搜尋並比對名稱、統編與聯絡資訊，避免重複建檔。",
        "有採購建立權限者可新增、修改或停用該公司供應商；採購或請款前，以原始文件核實交易幣別與收款資料。"
      ],
      "boundaries": [
        "停用供應商會保留既有採購歷史；供應商主檔不是付款完成證明。此頁不編輯收款帳戶，變更帳戶應依公司的核實流程。",
        "可見供應商不代表可跨公司查詢或修改付款。"
      ],
      "related": [
        "purchase-orders",
        "accounts-payable"
      ]
    },
    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "title": "Vendors",
        "summary": "Create and maintain vendor contacts, tax IDs and default currencies within an authorized company.",
        "category": "Purchasing and inventory",
        "keywords": [
          "Vendors",
          "vendor"
        ],
        "sections": {
          "steps": [
            "Select the company, then compare vendor names, tax IDs and contacts to avoid duplicates.",
            "Staff with purchase creation access can add, change or deactivate a vendor in that company. Verify currency and payee details against original documents before purchase or payment."
          ],
          "boundaries": [
            "Deactivating a vendor preserves purchase history. A vendor record is not evidence of payment. This page does not edit bank accounts; verify changes through the company process.",
            "Vendor visibility does not grant cross-company or payment-write access."
          ],
          "related": [
            "purchase-orders",
            "accounts-payable"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
