    "id": "employee-supervisor",
    "title": "員工部門與主管綁定",
    "summary": "在員工管理設定「所屬部門」與「部門主管」。部門設定可選共同作業角色及主管額外作業角色，主管保留部門共同作業，再加入額外功能。這些綁定須由有員工管理及帳號權限管理權限的人員維護。部門主管可查看本部門出勤與審核他人請假；薪資、財務、帳號管理及完整操作日誌不由部門角色自動授權。費用送審仍依「直屬主管」，已送出的申請不改派。",
    "keywords": [
      "員工",
      "人員",
      "直屬主管",
      "主管設定",
      "費用審批",
      "組織",
      "employees"
    ],
    "path": "/payroll/employees",
    "module": "employees",
    "category": "人資考勤",
    "group": "people",
    "sections": {
      "steps": [
        "在部門設定選共同作業角色與主管額外角色，再編輯員工的所屬部門。",
        "勾選「部門主管」後儲存；帳號與權限的「可見介面」會包含部門衍生權限。",
        "如需費用審批，另選同公司、啟用且可存取費用的直屬主管。既有審批人不會自動更換。"
      ],
      "boundaries": [
        "未設定主管旗標的人員不會因職稱或角色名稱被推定為主管。調部門、取消主管或停用後，後端重新核對權限。",
        "部門角色僅授予作業權限，個人明確授權仍保留；同仁薪資需 employee_compensation:read，薪酬修改另需 employee_compensation:update。財務與系統管理分別授權；不能審核自己的請假或費用。",
        "部門主管身分不自動取得考績權；評核人須有主管考核職務權限，且由人資或獲授權管理者在週期中逐筆指派。"
      ],
      "related": [
        "access-control",
        "expense-review",
        "attendance-admin",
        "performance-reviews"
      ]
    },
    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "title": "Employee department and supervisor binding",
        "summary": "Set Department and Department supervisor in the employee record. Shared department work permissions remain available to supervisors, who also receive configured additional operations and department attendance/leave review. Sensitive finance, salary, identity and audit access remain individual grants. Direct supervisors still route expenses; existing assignments do not change.",
        "category": "People and attendance",
        "keywords": [
          "Employees and direct supervisors",
          "employees"
        ],
        "sections": {
          "steps": [
            "Choose shared and additional supervisor work roles in department settings, then assign the employee department.",
            "Enable Department supervisor and save. The access preview includes derived department permissions. Changes require employee management and access-management authority.",
            "For expenses, separately choose an active same-company direct supervisor with expense access. Existing approval assignments are preserved."
          ],
          "boundaries": [
            "Titles or role names do not establish supervisor status. Transfers, demotion and deactivation are checked on subsequent server requests.",
            "Department grants are operational and additive. Coworker pay requires employee_compensation:read and compensation changes also require employee_compensation:update; finance and system access remain separate. Self-approval is blocked.",
            "Department supervisor status does not grant performance review access. The reviewer needs the review job permission and an explicit assignment in a cycle by HR or another authorized manager."
          ],
          "related": [
            "access-control",
            "expense-review",
            "attendance-admin",
            "performance-reviews"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "permissions": [
      "employees_admin:read"
    ],
