    "id": "warehouse",
    "title": "儲運工作區",
    "summary": "依角色開放儲運工作站、收貨、揀貨、出貨與報表；WMS 實際交運仍須在 ERP 逐行核銷才正式扣庫。",
    "keywords": [
      "儲運",
      "倉庫",
      "揀貨",
      "出貨",
      "WMS",
      "工作站"
    ],
    "path": "/warehouse",
    "module": "warehouse",
    "category": "儲運管理",
    "group": "warehouse",
    "sections": {
      "steps": [
        "從儲運工作台查看可用的作業與功能卡片。",
        "已設定 WMS 入口時，點選需要的功能並使用目前營運帳號進入授權的 WMS；未連線時只依實際載入內容判讀。",
        "WMS 完成實際交運並回傳物流與箱件證據後，到「交運待核銷」核對 ERP 銷單並逐行核准正式出庫。"
      ],
      "boundaries": [
        "ERP 入口與 WMS 內部權限都需通過。各環境只能進入對應的允許來源。",
        "裝箱完成不等於實際交運，更不等於 ERP 正式出庫；本目錄不保證 WMS 內部步驟或任務已完成。"
      ],
      "related": [
        "warehouse-workstation",
        "warehouse-picking",
        "warehouse-packing",
        "warehouse-overview",
        "wms-handover-reconciliation"
      ]
    },
    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "title": "Warehouse workspace",
        "summary": "Access authorized warehouse stations, receiving, picking, dispatch and reports. Actual WMS handover still needs line-by-line ERP reconciliation for final stock posting.",
        "category": "Warehouse",
        "keywords": [
          "Warehouse workspace",
          "warehouse"
        ],
        "sections": {
          "steps": [
            "Open the warehouse workspace to see available work and feature cards.",
            "When a WMS portal is configured, open the relevant destination using the current operations account; otherwise rely only on actually loaded data.",
            "After actual WMS handover supplies logistics and package evidence, compare it with the ERP sales order in Handover reconciliation and approve each line for final stock posting."
          ],
          "boundaries": [
            "Both ERP entry permissions and WMS permissions apply. Each environment only opens its allowlisted source.",
            "Packing alone is neither actual handover nor final ERP stock posting. This catalog does not certify completion of internal WMS tasks."
          ],
          "related": [
            "warehouse-workstation",
            "warehouse-picking",
            "warehouse-packing",
            "warehouse-overview",
            "wms-handover-reconciliation"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
