    "id": "business-entities",
    "title": "公司管理",
    "summary": "由最高管理員維護公司登入代碼、基本資料、幣別及啟用狀態。",
    "keywords": [
      "公司管理",
      "Company management"
    ],
    "module": "entities",
    "path": "/admin/entities",
    "category": "系統管理",
    "group": "admin",
    "sections": {
      "steps": [
        "最高管理員開啟公司管理，確認要新增或編輯的公司。",
        "填寫登入代碼、名稱、國別、基準幣別及必要聯絡資料；核對後儲存。",
        "建立初始管理員時依表單填寫必要資訊，另行安全交付初始登入資訊。"
      ],
      "boundaries": [
        "限 SUPER_ADMIN；一般 ADMIN 不能藉由知識指南建立公司或取得其他公司資料。",
        "停用公司會影響登入與業務存取，先確認目標；不要把初始密碼貼入對話。"
      ],
      "related": [
        "access-control",
        "employee-supervisor"
      ]
    },
    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "title": "Company management",
        "summary": "Super administrators maintain company login codes, details, currency and active status.",
        "category": "Administration",
        "keywords": [
          "Company management",
          "entities"
        ],
        "sections": {
          "steps": [
            "A super administrator opens company management and identifies the company to create or edit.",
            "Enter login code, name, country, base currency and required contacts, verify and save.",
            "When creating an initial administrator, fill required fields and deliver initial login information through a secure separate process."
          ],
          "boundaries": [
            "Only SUPER_ADMIN may manage companies; a guide does not grant ordinary admins company creation or cross-company access.",
            "Disabling a company affects access. Verify the target and never paste initial passwords into chat."
          ],
          "related": [
            "access-control",
            "employee-supervisor"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
